hem into parts:\n\n706,600,485 + 370,967,454. Let's split into millions and the rest.\n\n706,600,485 is 706 million plus 600,485.\n\n370,967,454 is 370 million plus 967,454.\n\nAdding the millions: 706 + 370 = 1,076 million.\n\nNow the remaining parts: 600,485 + 967,454. Let's add those:\n\n600,485 + 967,454. \n\nAdding the thousands: 600k + 967k = 1,567,000. Then the remaining 485 + 454 = 939. So total is 1,567,939.\n\nAdding that to the 1,076 million gives 1,076,000,000 + 1,567,939 = 1,077,567,939. Okay, that matches. So the answer should be correct.\n</think>\n\n",
