rts. Let's see:\n\n104,304,577 + 303,837,752. \n\nAdding the millions first: 104 million + 303 million = 407 million. \n\nThen the remaining parts: 304,577 + 837,752. \n\n304,577 + 800,000 = 1,104,577. Then adding 37,752 gives 1,142,329. \n\nSo total would be 407,000,000 + 1,142,329 = 408,142,329. That matches my previous result. Okay, that seems right.\n</think>\n\n",
