Let's split into 300,000 + 25,000 + 646 and 900,000 + 23,274. Adding the large chunks first: 300k +900k =1,200,000. Then 25k +23,274 =48,274. Then add 646 to that: 48,274 +646 =48,920. So total is 1,200,000 +48,920 =1,248,920. Yep, same result. Okay, confident now.\n</think>\n\n",
