ousands: 5 + 7 = 12 + 1 (carry) = 13. Write 3, carry 1 \u2714\ufe0f\nMillions: The carryover 1. So total is 1,356,284. \n\nHmm, that seems right. Alternatively, maybe I can add them by breaking down the numbers. Let's see:\n\n560,284 + 796,000. \n\nAdding the hundreds first: 560,284 + 700,000 = 1,260,284. Then add the remaining 96,000. \n\n1,260,284 + 96,000 = 1,356,284. Yep, same result. Okay, confident now.\n</think>\n\n",
