 any mistakes in the carry-overs or additions.\n\nWait, let me verify each step again quickly:\n\nOnes: 4+4=8 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nTens: 8+9=17 (write 7, carry 1) \u2714\ufe0f\n\nHundreds: 4+4+1=9 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nThousands: 3+3=6 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nTen-thousands: 8+7=15 (write 5, carry 1) \u2714\ufe0f\n\nHundred-thousands: 6+7+1=14 (write 4, carry 1) \u2714\ufe0f\n\nMillions: 1 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nYes, that seems right. So the total is indeed 1,456,978. I think that's the correct answer.\n</think>\n\n",
